# enchantment you control enters this turn, draw a card"), then an Ornithopter: Aunt May's "Whenever another creature you
# control enters, you gain 1 life" triggers twice (22 life) and the Rite's delayed ability once (one card). Three triggers
# to order. Aunt May entering earlier triggers nothing of its own ("another").
# Hand: 7 - 5 played on turn 1 = 2; turn 3 draws the Ornithopter (3), casts three (0), draws one = 1.

